<title>PERU: Port conditions update - Peru - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Peru - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PISCO, June 20 - The Port Authorities ordered that the port be closed to all traffic from 0001 this morning, due to very high winds and sea. No details were given about a proposed re-opening.</p>
</text>
